[I] Universal ATSC and DVB blind scanner

[T] w_scan2 is a small channel scan tool that generates channels.conf files
[T] for ATSC, DVB-C, DVB-S/S2 and DVB-T/T2 without needing initial tuning
[T] data. It detects the DVB or ATSC card automatically and supports many
[T] output formats; it is a fork of w_scan.

[U] https://github.com/stefantalpalaru/w_scan2

